Parkinsonism/Dystonia Syndrome Secondary
to Multiple Sclerosis with Antibasal
Ganglia Antibodies
Video
Multiple sclerosis (MS) is a common demyelinating disease
with a wide phenotypic spectrum. It is considered as an auto-
immune disorder based on its pathology, evidence of immune
